{"id":"05773b5ac46bc2b8","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-perfect-secrecy.md","title":"均匀有限密钥的完美保密","display":"df-perfect-secrecy — 均匀有限密钥的完美保密","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-perfect-secrecy","aliases":["28-df-perfect-secrecy"],"display":"df-perfect-secrecy — 均匀有限密钥的完美保密","depends_on":[],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Definition 9.1 and equation (9.1)","source_printed_pages":"174–175","source_pdf_pages":"200–201","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-perfect-secrecy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-perfect-secrecy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-perfect-secrecy — 均匀有限密钥的完美保密"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Definition 9.1 and equation (9.1)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"174–175"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"200–201"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal K,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal C\\)</span> 为非空有限集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E:\\mathcal K\\times\\mathcal M\\to\\mathcal C\">\\(E:\\mathcal K\\times\\mathcal M\\to\\mathcal C\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D:\\mathcal K\\times\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal M\">\\(D:\\mathcal K\\times\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal M\\)</span>。密钥在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\">\\(\\mathcal K\\)</span> 上均匀抽样，且独立于明文。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{PerfectSecret}(\\mathcal K,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal C,E,D)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\\left[\\forall k\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\forall m\\in\\mathcal M\\;D(k,E(k,m))=m\\right]\\\\&amp;\\land\\left[\\forall m,m&#39;\\in\\mathcal M\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathcal C\\;|\\{k\\in\\mathcal K:E(k,m)=y\\}|=|\\{k\\in\\mathcal K:E(k,m&#39;)=y\\}|\\right].\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{PerfectSecret}(\\mathcal K,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal C,E,D)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\\left[\\forall k\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\forall m\\in\\mathcal M\\;D(k,E(k,m))=m\\right]\\\\&amp;\\land\\left[\\forall m,m&#39;\\in\\mathcal M\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathcal C\\;|\\{k\\in\\mathcal K:E(k,m)=y\\}|=|\\{k\\in\\mathcal K:E(k,m&#39;)=y\\}|\\right].\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>计数等式除以相同非零|K|即每对明文的密文分布相同。正确性也显式包含在谓词中。原书使用固定长度二进制明文及密钥，本项是有限集合的同一条件，随后以这些具体集合实例化。它是信息论性质，没有PPT限制。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Definition 9.1 and equation (9.1)；印刷 pp.174–175 / PDF pp.200–201。本次核对范围：定义陈述与本地形式化。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal K,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"E:\\mathcal K\\times\\mathcal M\\to\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"D:\\mathcal K\\times\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal K","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{PerfectSecret}(\\mathcal K,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal C,E,D)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\\left[\\forall k\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\forall m\\in\\mathcal M\\;D(k,E(k,m))=m\\right]\\\\&\\land\\left[\\forall m,m'\\in\\mathcal M\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathcal C\\;|\\{k\\in\\mathcal K:E(k,m)=y\\}|=|\\{k\\in\\mathcal K:E(k,m')=y\\}|\\right].\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1693,"backlinks":[{"id":"94ded8b3ba316311","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\oplus$ 是等长二进制向量逐位模2加法；$\\operatorname{PerfectSecret}$ 见 [[28-df-perfect-secrecy]]。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-313","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-perfect-secrecy]]、[[28-ex-one-time-pad]]、[[28-thm-perfect-secrecy-key-bound]]、[[28-df-one-way-permutation]]、[[28-thm-ggm-prf]]、[[28-prop-one-time-pad-key-reuse]]。"},{"id":"287f5a015dc5ca38","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$；$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$k,x,x',y,y'\\in\\Sigma^n$；$\\operatorname{OTP}_n$ 见 [[28-ex-one-time-pad]]；$\\operatorname{PerfectSecret}$ 见 [[28-df-perfect-secrecy]]。"},{"id":"83377a9723d63a92","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal K,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal C,E,D$ 具有 [[28-df-perfect-secrecy]] 的类型和非空有限性条件。"}],"outgoing":[]}